Addresses four medication dashboard issues: icon selector showing outdated two-tone pills, special time medications not grouping on schedule, confusing button labels for pending doses, and lack of date navigation for late logging.

## Icon Updates

- Updated `pill-half` SVG to vertical split design (removed diagonal split and opacity attribute)
- Both JavaScript and PHP icon helpers now consistent

```javascript
// Before: diagonal split with opacity
svg: '<svg ...><path class="secondary-color" d="M12 4 A8 8 0 0 1 12 20 Z" opacity="0.85"/></svg>'

// After: vertical split, clean fill
svg: '<svg ...><path class="secondary-color" fill="currentColor" d="M 12 4 A 8 8 0 0 1 12 20 Z"/></svg>'
```

## Special Time Medication Grouping

- Medications with `special_timing` now group by label ("On waking", "Before bed") instead of dose time
- Custom sorting: "On waking" appears first, "Before bed" last
- Overdue thresholds: "On waking" after 9am, "Before bed" after 10pm

```php
// Group by special timing label when present
if (!empty($med['special_timing'])) {
    $timeKey = match($med['special_timing']) {
        'on_waking' => 'On waking',
        'before_bed' => 'Before bed',
        'with_meal' => 'With meal',
        default => date('H:i', strtotime($doseTime['dose_time']))
    };
}
```

## Button Label Clarity

Changed pending medication buttons from "✓ Taken" to "✓ Take" (status text remains "✓ Taken" after logging).

## Date Navigation & Late Logging

- Added Previous/Next day navigation with `?date=` parameter
- "Return to Today" button when viewing past dates
- Late logging modal prompts for reason when logging on different date
- New `late_logging_reason` column in `medication_logs` table

```javascript
// Detect late logging and show modal
const isLateLog = <?= json_encode(!$isToday) ?>;
if (isLateLog) {
    showLateLoggingModal();
}
```

## Migration Required

Run `run_late_logging_migration.php` to add `late_logging_reason VARCHAR(255) NULL` column with index.

