Adds instant AI consultation via local RAG (20 Q&A knowledge base), Google Maps Street View integration, and context-aware Zalo messaging with pre-filled property details.

## AI Knowledge Base (Local RAG)

Implemented fuzzy search over `data/land-law-2024.json` containing 20 Q&A pairs on Vietnamese land law and Đà Nẵng pricing:

```javascript
const fuzzySearch = (query, knowledgeBase) => {
  const normalizeText = (text) => text.toLowerCase()
    .normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g, '')
    .replace(/đ/g, 'd').trim();

  const scored = knowledgeBase.map(entry => {
    let score = 0;
    const questionNorm = normalizeText(entry.question);
    const keywordsNorm = entry.keywords.map(k => normalizeText(k));

    queryWords.forEach(word => {
      if (questionNorm.includes(word)) score += 10;
      keywordsNorm.forEach(kw => {
        if (kw.includes(word) || word.includes(kw)) score += 20;
      });
    });
    return { entry, score };
  });

  return scored.sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score)[0]?.entry;
};
```

Responses are instant (<100ms, no API calls). Query "giá đất Đà Nẵng 2026" returns detailed pricing by zone.

## Street View Integration

Added "Xem thực tế" button opening modal with embedded Street View iframe:

```javascript
<iframe src={`https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/streetview?key=${API_KEY}&location=${lat},${lng}&heading=0&pitch=0&fov=90`} />
```

## Smart Zalo Pre-fill

Zalo link now includes URL-encoded message with property context:

```javascript
href={`https://zalo.me/${phone}?text=${encodeURIComponent(
  `Chào anh/chị, tôi quan tâm lô đất ${so_to}/${so_thua} - DT ${dien_tich}m² - Giá ${price}. Xin vui lòng tư vấn thêm. Cảm ơn!`
)}`}
```

## Testing

Added `tests/v3-ai-oracle.spec.cjs` covering AI query responses, Street View modal, and Zalo link format.

## Files Changed

- `index.html`: +250 lines (fuzzy search, Street View modal, smart Zalo)
- `data/land-law-2024.json`: New 10KB knowledge base with 20 Q&A entries
- `tests/v3-ai-oracle.spec.cjs`: New test suite (5 scenarios)

No breaking changes to V2.5 features.

